Not included
------------

The raw datasets are not redistributed here. The COLOURlovers and MTurk-2011 families were
ingested for the data audit but are not used by any published model. The Sanzo Wada palettes
(Matt DesLauriers' MIT-licensed transcription, https://github.com/mattdesl/dictionary-of-colour-combinations;
the underlying 1933-34 work's U.S. status is unresolved) were ingested for the audit only and
are not in any published artifact or in the trained weights.

